
"smart_sources:Clippings/座舱电子电气架构与域控制器.md": {"path":"Clippings/座舱电子电气架构与域控制器.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"16zm2j5","at":1793006703818},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1792722715618,"size":5765,"at":1793006703819,"hash":"16zm2j5"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,10],"#":[11,41],"##{1}":[13,13],"##{2}":[14,14],"##{3}":[15,15],"##{4}":[16,16],"##{5}":[17,17],"##{6}":[18,18],"##{7}":[19,19],"##{8}":[20,20],"##{9}":[21,21],"##{10}":[22,41]},"outlinks":[{"title":"一文看懂智能座舱的演绎与构成","target":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzYzODA5MzYxNg==&mid=2247488970&idx=1&sn=0306f67acf1dc17de93204cf795db1a0&scene=142#wechat_redirect","line":34},{"title":"智能座舱系统总览","target":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzYzODA5MzYxNg==&mid=2247489213&idx=1&sn=660fc5a2bd145de4065a91f38ba37474&scene=142#wechat_redirect","line":39}],"metadata":{"title":"座舱电子电气架构与域控制器","source":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UUkdGhWFxMwTE-bTrST72g","author":null,"published":null,"created":"2026-10-23","description":"🚗 智能座舱的升级，背后首先是电子电气架构的变化。\n传统车型中，仪表、娱乐、空调和车身功能通常由多个ECU分别承担。随着功能持续增加，ECU数量、线束复杂度和软件维护难度也不断上升。\n⚙️ 座舱架构正在从分布式ECU走向域集中、跨域融合与中央计算。\n座舱域控制器开始集中承担计算、显示、通信和部分车身功能，进一步向舱驾融合和中央计算发展后，座舱与智驾之间还可以共享算力、数据和部分传感器资源。\n💰 集中式架构并不意味着单个控制器一定更便宜。\n高性能SoC、内存、存储、通信和热管理会推高单机成本，但同时可以减少ECU、线束、接口和重复算力，通过平台化和规模化实现整体成本优化。\n📈 架构竞争未来的重点，将从“控制器数量”转向计算资源利用率、软件复用能力和整车协同效率。\n📌 本期10张图，系统梳理分布式ECU、座舱域控制器、跨域融合以及中央计算的演进逻辑。\n📚 数据来源：公开资料整理与行业研究，仅供行业学习与交流，不构成任何商业或投资决策建议。\n相关文章：\n&lt;a data-unique-id=&quot;mvataiki-d51kvc&quot; href=&quot;https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzYzODA5MzYxNg==&amp;amp;mid=2247488970&amp;amp;idx=1&amp;amp;sn=0306f67acf1dc17de93204cf795db1a0&amp;amp;scene=142#wechat_redirect&quot; class=&quot;normal_text_link mp_article_text_link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-itemshowtype=&quot;0&quot;&gt;一文看懂智能座舱的演绎与构成&lt;/a&gt;\n\n&lt;a class=&quot;wx_topic_link&quot; topic-id=&quot;mv7tzt6j-zjtbwr&quot; style=&quot;color: #576B95 !important;&quot; data-topic=&quot;1&quot; data-recommend=&quot;&quot;&gt;#智能座舱&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;wx_topic_link&quot; topic-id=&quot;mv7tnfr3-v2a1ln&quot; style=&quot;color: #576B95 !important;&quot; data-topic=&quot;1&quot; data-recommend=&quot;&quot;&gt;#电子电气架构&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;wx_topic_link&quot; topic-id=&quot;mv7ts23c-vwaisn&quot; style=&quot;color: #576B95 !important;&quot; data-topic=&quot;1&quot; data-recommend=&quot;&quot;&gt;#域控制器&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;wx_topic_link&quot; topic-id=&quot;mv7tsao2-98nx5s&quot; style=&quot;color: #576B95 !important;&quot; data-topic=&quot;1&quot; data-recommend=&quot;&quot;&gt;#ECU&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;wx_topic_link&quot; topic-id=&quot;mv7tsqc8-2jqr6m&quot; style=&quot;color: #576B95 !important;&quot; data-topic=&quot;1&quot; data-recommend=&quot;&quot;&gt;#舱驾融合&lt;/a&gt; \n\n相关贴图：\n&lt;a data-unique-id=&quot;mv7u1xrl-a0irco&quot; href=&quot;https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzYzODA5MzYxNg==&amp;amp;mid=2247489213&amp;amp;idx=1&amp;amp;sn=660fc5a2bd145de4065a91f38ba37474&amp;amp;scene=142#wechat_redirect&quot; class=&quot;normal_text_link mp_article_text_link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-itemshowtype=&quot;8&quot;&gt;智能座舱系统总览&lt;/a&gt;","tags":["#clippings","#智能座舱","#电子电气架构","#域控制器","#ECU","#舱驾融合"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Clippings/座舱电子电气架构与域控制器.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1pz4c52","at":1793006703818},"key":"Clippings/座舱电子电气架构与域控制器.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,10],"size":2674,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
